These four permissions were removed from 04 Build/live/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml.
Send to PC is allowed to use INTERNET only. Local discovery code stays, and a missing
permission is reported instead of crashing the camera, the remote, or Send to PC.

<uses-permission android:name="android.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE" />
<uses-permission android:name="android.permission.CHANGE_WIFI_STATE" />
<uses-permission android:name="android.permission.CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE" />
<uses-permission
    android:name="android.permission.NEARBY_WIFI_DEVICES"
    android:usesPermissionFlags="neverForLocation" />
